# Rivulet 若 · 开源发布忽略规则
# 原则:任何运行时数据、凭证、私人内容、编译产物、大体积素材一律不入库。

# ---- 运行时数据 / 私人内容(最高优先级) ----
data/
**/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
session.bin
persona.json
persona.txt
persona.prev.json
persona.old.json
home.json
home_seed.json.bak
mood.json
qq.json
bili.json
qq_whitelist.json
qq_audit.jsonl
qq_audit.old.jsonl
qq_chat.jsonl
qq_messages.jsonl
daily_watch.jsonl
daily_state.json
idle_state.json
qzone_state.json
qzone_state.*
config.json
!core/config.example.json
*bili_cookie*
*cookie*.json
*.token
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ---- 编译 / 构建产物 ----
target/
target-fix/
dist/
portable/
backups/
build/
release/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.o
*.obj
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.fingerprint/
node_modules/

# ---- 视频 / 封面 / 素材(体积大且非源码) ----
promo/
work/
*.mp4
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mov
*.zip
*.7z
whale-compare.png
cmp_text.png

# ---- 临时 / 日志 ----
